msgctxt "136"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Uff..."

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Don't you usually wear a mask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I used to wear one when I was with the yakuza, but I don't\r\n"
"anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Why not? I thought you wanted to hide your identity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"A masked imposter showed up, pretending to be me. He ruined\r\n"
"my reputation and got me kicked out of my family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Besides, wearing a mask around Kamurocho just makes you\r\n"
"stick out like a sore thumb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "I'll give you that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"These days, the best way to hide your identity is to wear\r\n"
"a suit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "In this city, a suit is a mask of its own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "You've got a point there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Are you with the HLA?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Yeah, I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "I'll go with you, but I'm not talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"I know you're probably not the kind of guy to talk, but you've got the wrong"
" idea about the HLA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"The HLA is an organization that helps ex-yakuza. They're\r\n"
"not your enemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "They aren't going to force you to confess anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Once you meet them, you just might form a different opinion\r\n"
"of them."
msgstr ""

